1. She grew up in a rough area that is technically considered disadvantaged. (Verbatim: "the area I grew up in, technically rough, but, okay, and here's the big but...")
2. Growing up in a rough area helped her qualify for scholarships due to geographic criteria. (Verbatim: "the benefit of being raised in an area like that is it definitely helps with scholarships, for sure...")
3. She has a low personal standard for living conditions, with "no mold" being her baseline expectation. (Verbatim: "my standard? Yeah. I just don't want- I feel like it'd be really bad for my health if I had it, but I'm doing very well at making sure there is none.")
4. She finds comfort in cozy, relaxed environments reminiscent of visual novel settings. (Verbatim: "It reminds me of the comfy rooms I've seen in visual novels. It feels like I could sit in it for hours and relax.")
5. She has a strong preference for calm, non-upbeat background music that doesn’t cause mental fatigue. (Verbatim: "I want to make sure I can listen to it on repeat and like something that helps me concentrate as well a bit.")
6. She avoids lo-fi music because it makes her fall asleep, especially during study sessions. (Verbatim: "lo-fi makes me go to sleep, so... Which again, what's happened when I was a student, I'd be like, 'Yeah, time to study!' Puts on lo-fi.")
7. She has been using the same background music since her debut, indicating long-term attachment to it. (Verbatim: "I haven't changed my BGM since debut. I've had the same BGM like the whole time...")
8. She appreciates high-quality outfit rigging and has a strong emotional connection to her riggers. (Verbatim: "They did a fantastic job! Absolutely fantastic! Especially with their hair!")
9. She has a specific preference for twin tails in her character design. (Verbatim: "Sorry, twin tails are my weakness! Can't resist!")
10. She is frustrated with YouTube’s technical limitations, particularly regarding music usage and chat functionality. (Verbatim: "YouTube can't even do the basic things anymore. It's just, ah, fix yourself, YouTube, I beg thee.") [end of text]



1. She has a strong emotional connection to her fans, expressing gratitude for their support during her offline time. (Verbatim: "It's really nice to know that y'all don't forget me when I'm offline.")
2. She fears being forgotten or irrelevant when not streaming, comparing herself to an NPC that disappears when offline. (Verbatim: "Sometimes I worry, I'm like an NPC that doesn't exist unless I'm online and then I disappear into the void.")
3. She struggles with taking time off and often cancels planned breaks due to her streaming schedule. (Verbatim: "I can't even take like one day off. I'm like, 'I'm gonna take a day off!' 'Clicks go live.'")
4. She has a deep affection for the Nintendo Switch and prefers to associate the term "Switch" exclusively with the gaming console. (Verbatim: "I like the idea of Switch only referring to the Nintendo Switch.")
5. She is emotionally attached to her new outfit, particularly the ponytail and glasses combination, which she describes as her "dream girl" aesthetic. (Verbatim: "It's just exactly how I picture my dream girl to be like...")
6. She enjoys the idea of co-working streams and envisions a shared workspace with her fans. (Verbatim: "We can do some co-working streams together.")
7. She identifies with both older sister (Onee-san) and younger sister archetypes due to being a middle child. (Verbatim: "I am both older sister and younger sister because I am the middle child.")
8. She has a strong emotional reaction to fan-submitted content, especially when it's unexpected or heartfelt. (Verbatim: "I'm just bamboozled... there's no way y'all be resubscribing for six more months...")
9. She is passionate about Mario Kart and still feels upset about losing to a banana and blue shell. (Verbatim: "I'm still upset, stupid mario cart banana blue shell punk.")
10. She admires the idea of being a wizard and has a fondness for magical, powerful imagery. (Verbatim: "Half of me was like should I have been a wizard?") [end of text]



